            "relation": "INHERITED_FROM",
            "target_entity_instance": "MODIS VCF",
            "target_entity_type": "Source",
            "paragraph": "In addition, the Common Land Model version 2024 (CoLM 2024) (Dai et al., 2003) provides a global 500 m PFT dataset for the period 2000\u20132020. This dataset was generated by combining several satellite products, including MODIS VCF to determine the fractional cover of trees, non-tree vegetation and bare soil; AVHRR VCF to distinguish tree types; and the ESA LC_CCI land cover product with its cross-walking table to get the fraction of different non-tree vegetation types.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
